      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FARMOR AGAIN (6) finished seventh last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in her blistering 21.74 win at this track over 380m. Smart win two back and looks a key chance here. RINGWALD (1) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 21.74 beating Eternal Winter. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. DIFFERENT HERE (2) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 1.5 lengths back in third (29.37) at this track in a Mix 5 over 498m. Likely to be in the finish again. COLONEL'S RANGER (8) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
